        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Acorn WPEBP, 15\" Warwick Rough Iron Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade by Acorn, the WPEBP 15\" Pull has a rough iron finish that mimics the texture of naturally weathered iron. This finish comes with a lifetime no rust warranty. The Warwick Handleset has a decorative engraved handle as well as a beautiful crest detail on the top and bottom. This door pull is surfaced mounted and can be easily installed with just a few screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: Matching <a href=\"/products/15-inch-warwick-push-plate-acorn-wnbbp\"><b>Push Plate</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>\r\nSpecifications</b> for the Warwick Rough Iron 15 Inch Iron Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Rough Texture Black Iron</b></li>\r\n<li>Length: 15\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Length to Center: 5-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Handle Shape: Square</li>\r\n<li><b>Lifetime No-Rust Warranty!</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually. Package includes 1 pull and hardware for a surface mounted application. All dimensions are approximate.</i>\r\n</p>",
